sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant K8s as Kubernetes
    participant Pod1 as ProximaDB Pod (AZ-1)
    participant Pod2 as ProximaDB Pod (AZ-2)
    participant ObjectStorage as Object Storage
    participant GeoReplica as Geo-Replicated Storage
    
    Note over Client,GeoReplica: Normal Operation - Stateless Deployment
    
    Client->>K8s: Vector Search Request
    K8s->>Pod1: Route to Active Pod
    Pod1->>ObjectStorage: Read Metadata/Data
    ObjectStorage-->>Pod1: Return Data
    Pod1-->>Client: Search Results
    
    Note over Pod1,ObjectStorage: Continuous Replication
    ObjectStorage->>GeoReplica: Async Replication (continuous)
    
    Note over Client,GeoReplica: Failure Scenario - AZ-1 Goes Down
    
    Client->>K8s: Vector Search Request
    Note over Pod1: ❌ AZ-1 Failure
    K8s->>Pod2: Instant Failover (<1s)
    Pod2->>ObjectStorage: Read Same Data
    ObjectStorage-->>Pod2: Return Data
    Pod2-->>Client: Search Results
    
    Note over Client,GeoReplica: Region Failure - Disaster Recovery
    
    Note over ObjectStorage: ❌ Primary Region Down
    K8s->>Pod2: Deploy in DR Region
    Pod2->>GeoReplica: Read from Replica
    GeoReplica-->>Pod2: Return Data (15-min old)
    Pod2-->>Client: Search Results
    
    Note over Client,GeoReplica: Cost Savings Achieved
    
    rect rgb(144, 238, 144)
        Note over K8s,ObjectStorage: Simplified Architecture: Reduced operational overhead
        Note over K8s,ObjectStorage: Built-in Resilience: No custom HA setup
        Note over K8s,ObjectStorage: Cloud-Native Storage: Cost-effective data persistence
    end
    
    Note over Client,GeoReplica: Performance Metrics
    
    rect rgb(135, 206, 235)
        Note over Pod1,Pod2: RTO: <1 minute (AZ failover)
        Note over Pod1,Pod2: RTO: 15 minutes (Region failover)
        Note over ObjectStorage,GeoReplica: RPO: 0 (continuous replication)
        Note over Client,K8s: Availability: 99.99%
        Note over Pod1,ObjectStorage: Latency: 0.9ms (gRPC)
    end
